{"chapter":5,"title":"Mechanical Fasteners","words":[{"term":"fastener","vi":"chốt nối, chi tiết kẹp chặt (vít, bu lông, đinh…)","ipa":"/ˈfɑːsnə/","audio":"/assets/avcn/chapter-5/audio/03a3923ce9.mp3"},{"term":"nail","vi":"cái đinh (đời thường còn là móng tay)","ipa":"/neɪl/","audio":"/assets/avcn/chapter-5/audio/a832d9db76.mp3"},{"term":"screw","vi":"đinh vít, vít","ipa":"/skruː/","audio":"/assets/avcn/chapter-5/audio/e27f5dd386.mp3"},{"term":"bolt","vi":"bu lông","ipa":"/bəʊlt/","audio":"/assets/avcn/chapter-5/audio/55e75232d0.mp3"},{"term":"pin","vi":"chốt, ghim","ipa":"/pɪn/","audio":"/assets/avcn/chapter-5/audio/4392e2b546.mp3"},{"term":"nut","vi":"đai ốc, con tán (đời thường: quả hạch)","ipa":"/nʌt/","audio":"/assets/avcn/chapter-5/audio/06d720a568.mp3"},{"term":"washer","vi":"vòng đệm, long đền","ipa":"/ˈwɒʃə/","audio":"/assets/avcn/chapter-5/audio/254d546dfe.mp3"},{"term":"anchor","vi":"tắc kê, nở (đời thường: mỏ neo)","ipa":"/ˈæŋkə/","audio":"/assets/avcn/chapter-5/audio/eeb805f917.mp3"},{"term":"clamp","vi":"cái kẹp, vam kẹp","ipa":"/klæmp/","audio":"/assets/avcn/chapter-5/audio/cd913cb269.mp3"},{"term":"grade","vi":"cấp bền của bu lông","ipa":"/ɡreɪd/","audio":"/assets/avcn/chapter-5/audio/bb77b64376.mp3"},{"term":"thread","vi":"ren (đời thường: sợi chỉ)","ipa":"/θred/","audio":"/assets/avcn/chapter-5/audio/7cdb3c65dd.mp3"},{"term":"metric thread","vi":"ren hệ mét","ipa":"/ˈmetrɪk θred/","audio":"/assets/avcn/chapter-5/audio/c74da46ccb.mp3"},{"term":"hex head","vi":"đầu lục giác","ipa":"/heks hed/","audio":"/assets/avcn/chapter-5/audio/f93bf0c27c.mp3"},{"term":"socket head","vi":"đầu lục giác chìm","ipa":"/ˈsɒkɪt hed/","audio":"/assets/avcn/chapter-5/audio/95db2b6f91.mp3"},{"term":"clockwise","vi":"theo chiều kim đồng hồ","ipa":"/ˈklɒkwaɪz/","audio":"/assets/avcn/chapter-5/audio/64c7cf5031.mp3"},{"term":"rivet","vi":"đinh tán","ipa":"/ˈrɪvɪt/","audio":"/assets/avcn/chapter-5/audio/d8a5c966a7.mp3"},{"term":"blind rivet","vi":"đinh tán rút, đinh rive (còn g